  "bio": "Beatriz Villacortas, based in Dundee, United Kingdom, is a master tattoo artist specializing in realism and illustrative styles. With an impressive portfolio displayed on @thehiveink.co.uk, her skill level is unrivaled and she brings to life unique and vivid designs with great precision, shading, and detailing. Exemplifying utmost professionalism, Beatriz maintains a clean and hygienic workspace, further enhancing the tattoo experience for clients.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Dundee, Scotland, United Kingdom"
